cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper."
title: "A Differentiable CVaR Projection Primitive for Risk-Constrained Optimization"
authors:
  - family-names: "Christy"
    given-names: "Riyan"
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/riyan-christy/diff-cvar-projection"
abstract: >
  A differentiable, batched CVaR (expected-shortfall) projection primitive. The
  forward pass calls any exact top-k-sum projection; the backward pass exploits
  the active polyhedral face of the projected point, giving an O(m)
  vector-Jacobian product with no deterministic-equivalent CVaR epigraph.

